/*
 * Manufactured engineering materials (incl. Guardian & Thargoid).
 *
 * Source:       EDCD FDevIDs, material.csv
 *               https://github.com/EDCD/FDevIDs
 *               Community-maintained Frontier id/name registry. No explicit
 *               licence is stated; consult the repository terms.
 * Secondary:    INARA (https://inara.cz/elite/components/) for the caustic /
 *               Titan Thargoid materials absent from the pinned FDevIDs source.
 *
 * Each record is { symbol, name, elementSymbol, grade, line }. `symbol` is
 * Frontier's internal id (matched case-insensitively, as the journal reports
 * it); `name` is the display name. `grade` is 1-5 (raw tops out at 4) and is
 * itself the rarity. `line` is the in-game group.
 * `elementSymbol` is null — only raw materials (elements) have one.
 * The caustic / Titan Thargoid materials absent from FDevIDs have grades that
 * comes from INARA (see data/materials/SOURCES.md).
 *
 * Full provenance: data/materials/SOURCES.md.
 */
